# Convex's generated API bindings are NOT ignored: `convex codegen` (and Convex's
# own CLI docs) require them to be committed, because the app cannot typecheck or
# bundle without them. Builds run `scripts/convex-codegen.mjs`, which refreshes
# them when CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY is available and otherwise uses these files.
